message: "If you use this figure, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "An End-to-End Visual Guide to Nested Cross-Validation and Model Selection"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
authors:
  - family-names: Gross
    given-names: Amit
