keywords:
  - machine learning
  - cross-validation
  - nested cross-validation
  - model selection
  - hyperparameter optimization
  - model evaluation
abstract: >-
  A one-page educational figure explaining nested cross-validation with model
  selection: an outer k-fold loop to evaluate each model, an inner k-fold loop
  with a hyperparameter optimizer to tune it, a comparison across models, and a
  final tuning and test of the winner.
